This product includes capabilities and implementations absorbed from WebMux
(https://github.com/windmill-labs/webmux), frozen at commit
d8c9d5fa2fc061bff1425de2910d784a48961f1e (v0.43.1, 2026-08-14), which is
acknowledged here as an architectural origin.

No file from that project is reproduced verbatim in this repository. Every
absorbed unit was ported or adapted to the Node.js runtime, because the WebMux
backend is Bun-only and does not compile under Node without translation. The
origin-to-destination mapping for every ported unit is recorded in
docs/provenance.md, and the behavioural chain for every ported module is
recorded in docs/absorption-trace.md.

WebMux declares "license": "MIT" in its package.json and publishes no LICENSE
file. While that remains the case, no verbatim copy is made from it.
